sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Store Operator
    participant MedusaAdmin as Medusa Admin UI
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API
    participant FulfillMod as Fulfillment Module
    participant ManualSvc as ManualFulfillmentService
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Admin,DB: Shipping option setup
    Admin->>MedusaAdmin: Configure shipping method
    MedusaAdmin->>MedusaAPI: GET /admin/fulfillment-providers/:id/options
    MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: getFulfillmentOptions("manual")
    FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: getFulfillmentOptions()
    ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: [{ id: "manual-fulfillment" }, { id: "manual-fulfillment-return", is_return: true }]
    FulfillMod-->>MedusaAPI: options
    MedusaAPI-->>MedusaAdmin: shipping options
    Admin->>MedusaAdmin: Select "manual-fulfillment", set price $5.00
    MedusaAdmin->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/shipping-options { provider_id: "manual", amount: 5.00 }
    MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: validateOption({ id: "manual-fulfillment" })
    FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: validateOption(data)
    ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: true
    FulfillMod-->>DB: save ShippingOption
    DB-->>FulfillMod: saved
    MedusaAPI-->>MedusaAdmin: shipping option created

    Note over Admin,DB: Order placed + Fulfillment created
    MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: canCalculate("manual")
    FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: canCalculate()
    ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: false
    Note right of FulfillMod: Static price used (no dynamic calculation)
    MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: validateFulfillmentData(optionData, data, context)
    FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: validateFulfillmentData(optionData, data, context)
    ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: data (pass-through)
    Admin->>MedusaAdmin: Create fulfillment for order
    MedusaAdmin->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/orders/:id/fulfillments
    MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: createFulfillment(data, items, order, fulfillment)
    FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: createFulfillment()
    ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: { data: {}, labels: [] }
    FulfillMod->>DB: save Fulfillment { data: {}, labels: [] }
    DB-->>FulfillMod: saved
    FulfillMod-->>MedusaAPI: fulfillment
    MedusaAPI-->>MedusaAdmin: { fulfillment }

    Note over Admin,DB: Manual ship + Cancel
    Admin->>MedusaAdmin: Mark as shipped (ships package externally)
    MedusaAdmin->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/fulfillments/:id/shipments
    MedusaAPI->>DB: update Fulfillment.shipped_at
    DB-->>MedusaAPI: updated
    MedusaAPI-->>MedusaAdmin: fulfillment shipped

    alt Cancel fulfillment
        Admin->>MedusaAdmin: Cancel fulfillment
        MedusaAdmin->>MedusaAPI: POST /admin/fulfillments/:id/cancel
        MedusaAPI->>FulfillMod: cancelFulfillment(fulfillment)
        FulfillMod->>ManualSvc: cancelFulfillment()
        ManualSvc-->>FulfillMod: {} (no-op)
        FulfillMod->>DB: update Fulfillment.canceled_at
        DB-->>FulfillMod: updated
        MedusaAPI-->>MedusaAdmin: cancelled
    end
